
    Once you unlharc THISISIT.LHA, a file called VoteNotice.rexx will be in
  the directory JMP:Vote/.

    This is a program that takes the place of "CheckNew.Skyline".  Run it
  in a file like "TXT:Envir/MustRead", and it will notify the users if they
  have any new polls waiting for them, and if they configure their accounts,
  it will automatically load up Vote.

    The code of this program may not be altered in any way EXCEPT for the
  CONFIGURABLES section, be sure to edit it to your liking.
